<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/13/eng@/~cl_9__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Any investigation, prosecution or proceedings in respect of any offence under the principal Act pending under the principal Act may, on the date of coming into operation of this Act, be continued as if the principal Act had not been amended by this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/13/eng@> .
